<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">2 Qorontoosa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Qorontoosa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Qoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Qorontoosa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Qorontoosa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Nam7antho Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Qorontoosa asaas xaafida nam7antho kiitay xaafetiday, iyaw Qorontoosa woosa keethara de7iya gahetethay meto giddo gelidi de7iya wodena. Issi issi woosa keetha asati Phawuloosa daro borikoka, I siga medhanaw koyeysa enta bessis. Enta bolla godatishenne wolqa bessishe entako baanaw koybeenna (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1:23">1:23</ref></char>). Enti Phawuloosa kiita si7idi issoy issuwas atto gaana melanne woli minthethana mela enta zorees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 2:5-11">2:5-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ba kiitan, Qorontoosa woosa keethara iyaw de7iya gahetetha qoncisidi, woosa keethan medhetida iitabasinne ixuwas ayis mino zaaro immidako odees. Iyara gathidi iya seeray enta nagarape zaaridi sigako ehida gisho, I ufaytida ufaysa entaw qoncisees. Kaallidika, Yihudan de7iya ammaniya asaa maaddanaw bantaw de7iyabaape coo immana mela hassaysees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wursetha shempotan qassi, Qorontoosa woosa keethan de7iya issi issi asati bantana, “Tuma hawaare” oothidi ekidi, Phawuloosa “Wordo hawaare” oothidi iya mootiya gisho, ba hawaaretetha maata bolla dendida mootuwas zaaro immees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosanne Qorontoosa woosa keetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 1:12-2:17">1:12—2:17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosa siiqoy hintena kaaletho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 3:1-7:16">3:1—7:16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihudan metootetida asaas imetiya imota <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosi tuma hawaare <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1—13:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Xoossa shenen Yesuus Kiristoosa hawaare gidida Phawuloosinne, nu ishaa Ximotiyoosi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Qorontoosan de7iya Xoossaa woosa keethaasinne Akaya biittan de7iya Xoossaa asa ubbaas xaafida kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Hawa 18:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Xoossaa nu Aawapenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosape, aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hintew gido.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Xoosse Galatees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Maarotetha Aawas, ubba wode nuna minthethiya Xoossaas, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa Aawas galati gido. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Xoossay nuus immida minthethuwan, meton de7eyisata nu minthethana mela Xoossay nuna nu meto ubban minthethees. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Nuuni Kiristoosa daro waayiya shaaketidaysada qassi nuuni iya daro minthethuwan minnana. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Nuuni waayetiko hessi hintena minthethanaasanne hintena ashshanaasa. Qassi nuuni minetiko nuuni gencida waayiya mela hinteka gencidi, Xoossay hintew immiya minthethuwan minnana. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Hinte nu ekida metuwa mela ekidi, nu minthethuwan shaaketanaysa nu eriya gisho nu ufaysay hintenan mino.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Nu ishato, Iise biittan nuna gakida metuwa hinte erana mela koyoos. He nuna gakida metoy nu wolqaafe darin, hayqonna attoko gidi ufaysi qanxidashin. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Nuuni nu bolla hayqo pirdi pirdetida mela qopida. Shin nuuni nu huuphen gidonashin, hayqidaysata denthiya Xoossan ammanetana mela hessi hanis. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Xoossay hessa mela iita hayqope nuna ashshis; ha77ika ashshana; sinthafeka I nuna ashshana gidi iyan ufaysi wothoos. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Woosan nuna maaddite. Daro woosa gaason Xoossaa maaduwa nu demmiya wode daro asay nu gisho Xoossaa galatoosona.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Ba Halchuwa Laammis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Nuuni nu geeshsha kahan ceeqetoos. Nuuni ha alamiyan de7ida de7uwan ubbaraka hintera nu de7ida de7uwan tumatethaninne suuretethan hintera de7ida. Hessika, ha alamiya cincatethan gidonashin, Xoossaa aadho keehatethaana. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Nu hintew xaafida dabdaabey hinte nabbabanawunne akeekanaw danda7iyabaape attishin, haraa gidenna. Hinte iya akeekanaw danda7eysa ta ammanayis. <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />Ha77i hinte nuna hanida keena ereeta, shin sinthafe kumethi eranaysa ta ammanetayis. Nu Godaa Yesuusi simmiya wode nuuni hintenan ceeqetidaysada hinteka nunan ceeqetana.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Hessa taani loytha erida gisho, hinte nam7antho go7etana mela kasetada hinteko baanaw qofa qachas. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Taani Maqedoone bashenne yaape simmashe hintena be7ana. Taani yaape Yihuda biya wode hinte tana ta ogiyan maaddana gada qopas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Hawa 19:21</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Taani hessa gashe ay oothanaw bessiyako eronna asi daaniyana? Woyko taani ta qofaa qachiya wode asa qofada, issi toho “Ee” qassi issi toho “Akay” giya asa meleyee?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Shin Xoossay ammaneteysa gidiya gisho, nu hintew odiya qaalay “Ee” woyko “Akay” geysa gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Taani, Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi hintew markatida Xoossaa Na7ay, Yesuus Kiristoosi ubba wode “Eepe” attishin, “Ee” nne “Akay” gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Hawa 18:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Xoossay immana gida ubbay Kiristoosa baggara “Ee” gidees. Nuuni Kiristoosa baggara Xoossaa bonchoos, “Amin7i” gey hessa gishosa. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Nunne hinte Kiristoosan minnidi eqana mela oothidaynne ba oosuwas dooriday Xoossaa. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Nuuni iyabaa gideysa erisanaw ba maatamiya nu bolla wothis; qassi ba Geeshsha Ayyaana oythi oothidi nu wozanan wothis.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Taani Qorontoosa boonna aggiday hinte azzanonna attana melasa; hessi wordo gidiko Xoossay ta shempuwa taape eko. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Hinte, hinte ammanuwan minnidi de7iya gisho, nu hintena ufaysanaw hintera issife ootheysatape attishin, hintena wolqan ammantheyisata gidoko.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Taani nam7antho hinteko biike gada qofa qachiday hintena azzanthonna agganaasa. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Taani hintena azzanthikoka ta azzanthida hintefe hari tana ufaysanaw de7ey oonee? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Taani hintew he dabdaabiya xaafiday, ta hintena be7anaw biya wode tana ufaysanaw bessiya asan ta azzananaw koyonna gishosa. Ta ufaytiya wode hinte ubbayka ufaytanaysa ta ammanayis. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Taani daro waayeninne un7an qassi daro afuthan xaafiday, hintena azzanthanaasa gidonashin, taani hintena ubbaa ay mela dosiyako hintena erisana melasa.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Qohida Asi Atto Guussu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ase azzanthida oonika de7iko ta iya naaquwa darsanaw koyikefe attishin, tana gidonashin, hintefe darota azzanthis. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Hintefe dariya asay he uraa seerida seeray iyaw gidana. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Hessa gisho, he uray daro azzanidi, ufaysi qanxonna mela hinte iya maaranawunne minthethanaw bessees. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Hinte iya siiqeysa zaari iyaw qoncisana mela ta hintena woossayis. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ta he dabdaabiya hintew xaafiday, hinte paacetidi, ubbaban taw kiiteteysa eranaw koyida gishosa. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Hinte maariya uraa taka maarana. Taani maaranabay aybi de7ikoka, Kiristoosa sinthan hinte gisho gada maaras. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Taani hessa oothiday Xalahiya cimo oosuwa nu eriya gisho, xalahen cimetonna attana melasa.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosan De7iya Xoono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Taani Kiristoosa Wongela sabbakanaw Xiro7aada bida wode, Goday yan taw ooso oge giigisidi wothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Hawa 20:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Shin taani ta ishaa Tito yan demmaboonna gisho ta wozanay shempibeenna. Hessa gisho, yan de7iya asaa sarothada iya koyanaw Maqedoone bas.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Shin Kiristoosa baggara ubba wode nuna xoonon kaalethiyanne shitto mela sawiya Kiristoosaba nu eriya timirtiya ubba bessi gathana mela oothiya Xoossaa galati gako. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Nuuni attiya asaa giddoninne dhayiya asaa giddon Kiristoosa baggara Xoossas imetida sawiya shitto mela. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Dhaya asaas hayqoko efiya hayqo peeno; qassi attiya asaas de7oko efiya de7o sawo; yaatin, hessa mela oosos gidanay oonee? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Nuuni Xoossaa qaala wodhe demmanaw koyidi walakidi zal7iya daro asaa mela gidoko. Shin Xoossay kiitida suure asata mela Kiristoosan de7idi Xoossaa sinthan qaala odoos.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Nuuni zaaridi nuna sabbinoyee? Woyko hara asada, saba dabdaabiya hintew yeddanaw woyko hintefe ekanaw nuna koshshiyee? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Asi ubbay hintena erana melanne nabbabana mela hinte nu wozanan xaafetidi de7iya nu dabdaabe. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Hinte qalamen gidonashin, de7o Xoossaa Ayyaanan, shucha bolla gidonashin, asa wozanan xaafetidaysatanne nunan haggaazetida Kiristoosa dabdaabe gideysa bessideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kessa 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Ermi 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Hiz 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Nu hessa giday, Kiristoosa baggara Xoossan ammanoy nuus de7iya gishosa. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Nu hessa oothanaw danda7iday Xoossaa wolqaanape attishin, nuuni nu wolqan aykoka oothanaw danda7oko. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Nu ooratha caaquwa oosanchota gidana mela Xoossay nuna danda7isis. He ooratha caaqoy Geeshsha Ayyaanan bentidaysafe attishin, xaafetida higgen gidenna. Higgey wodhees, shin Geeshsha Ayyaanay de7o immees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Ermi 31:31</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Shucha bolla xaafetida higgey imetiya wode Xoossaa bonchoy qoncis. Muse som7uwan de7iya bonchoy dhayishe biyaba gidikoka, Isra7eele asay iya som7uwa tishshi oothidi xeellanaw danda7ibookona. Hiza, hayqo ehiya higgey hessa mela bonchon qonciko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:29">Kessa 34:29</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />yaatin, Geeshsha Ayyaanan oosetiya oosuwa bonchoy waanidi aadhenee? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Asa bolla pirda ehiya higgey boncho gidiko yaatin, ase xillisiya ooratha ogey waanidi aadhidi bonchetennee? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Kase boncho gididaysa ha77i aadhiya bonchoy de7eysara gathi be7iya wode bonchoy baynaba gidis. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Guutha wodes qoncidi guyepe dhaydaysi haysada bonchetiko, merinaw de7eysi waanidi aadhidi bonchetennee?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nuus haysa mela ufaysay de7iya gisho, yeellatonna odetoos. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Nuuni, Isra7eele asay dhayishe biya bonchuwa wursethaa be7onna mela ba som7uwa kammida Muse mela gidoko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kessa 34:33</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Shin enta wozanay doccis. Hachi gakanaw enti gal7a caaquwa nabbabiya wode enta wozanay he kaman kametidi de7ees. He kamay Kiristoosa xalaalan qaaretees. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Shin hachi gakanawuka enti Muse maxaafaa nabbabiya wode ubban he kamay enta wozanaa kammees. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Shin oonika Godaako simmiya wode awudeka he kamay qaaretees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Kessa 34:34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Goday Ayyaana; Godaa Ayyaanay de7iya bessan la77atethi de7ees. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Nuuni ubbay kametiboonna som7on Godaa bonchuwa be7ana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Be7ana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mastooteda zaaridi phoolisana geetetidi birshetanaw danda7ees.</char></note> Nuuni Ayyaana gidida Godaa malaa daananaw bonchofe bonchon laametana.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Meqa Miishen De7iya Buqura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Hiza, Xoossay ba maarotethan ha oosuwa nuus immida gisho, nuuni ufaysi qanxoko. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Nuuni yeellaya geema ooso ubbaa aggida; gene ooso oothoko; Xoossaa qaala wordora walakoko. Tumaa qoncen haasayishe, asa ubbaa kahay nuna ekana mela Xoossaa sinthan nuna shiishoos.<verse eid="2CO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Nu odiya Wongelay geemmidaba gidikoka, geemmiday dhayo ogen de7iya asaasa. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Ha alamiya haariya xoossay ammanonna asaa wozanaa goozis. Enti Xoossaa mela gidida Kiristoosa boncho Wongela poo7uwa be7onna mela diggis. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Nuuni, Yesuus Kiristoosi Godaa gideysanne nu iya gisho hinte oosancho gideysa odoosipe attishin, nubaa odoko. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />“Dhuman poo7oy poo7o” gida Xoossay, Kiristoosa som7uwan poo7iya Xoossaa bonchuwa eraa poo7uwa immanaw ba poo7uwa nu wozanan poo7isis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Medhe 1:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Shin ubbaafe aadhiya wolqay nubaa gidonashin, Xoossaba gideysa bessanaw ha boncho shaloy meqa miishe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meqa mishe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan meqa miishe geetetiday biittafe oosetida miisheta bessanaasa, hessatika, oto, shaate, beshe, xugga, xaaronne entana daneyisata</char></note> gidida nu asatethan de7ees.<verse eid="2CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Nu ubba baggaraka waayetida, shin meqeretibooko. Nuus haddirsi gidis, shin ufaysi qanxibooko. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Nu, morketan goodetida, shin lagge dhaybooko. Nu morketan shocetidi kundida, shin dhaybooko. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Yesuusa de7oy nu asatethan qoncana mela iya hayquwa ubba wode nu asatethan tookidi yuuyoos. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Yesuusa de7oy hayqiya nu asatethan qoncana mela paxa de7iya nuuni iya gisho, ubba wode hayqos aadhidi imetoos. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Hiza, hayqoy nunan oothiya wode de7oy hintenan oothees.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ta ammanas; hessa gisho odas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Maz 116:10</ref>.</char></note> yaagetis. Hessa mela ammanoy nuus de7iya gisho haasayoos. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Godaa Yesuusa hayqope denthida Xoossay, nunaka Yesuusara hayqope denthanaysanne hintera issife ba sinthe shiishanaysa eroos. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Hessi ubbay haniday hinte gishosa. Xoossaa aadho keehatethay daro asaa gakiya wode asay Xoossaa bonchuwas daro galataa immana.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Hessa gisho, nuuni ufaysi qanxoko. Nu bentiya asatethay daaburishe biyaba gidikoka, nu ayyaana asatethay gallas gallas ooraxees. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ha77is nuuni waayetiya ha kawusha waayey, ubbaafe keehi gitatiya merinaa bonchuwa nuus imisana. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Nuuni bentiyaba gidonashin, bentonnaba xeelloos. Bentiyabay ha77isa, shin bentonnabay merinaasa.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Ha77i nu de7iya dunkaane daaniya ha sa7a asatethay laaletikoka, asi keexiboonna, Xoossay keexida merinaa keethay nuus salon de7eysa eroos. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Salo asatethaa ma7anaw amotishe ha77i ha sa7an de7ishe oolos. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Nuuni hessa ma7iya wode kallotoko. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Dunkaane daaniya ha sa7a asatethan nu de7ishe deexetidi oolos. Hayqiya nu asatethay de7on laametana mela salo asatethaa ma7anaw koyoosipe attishin, ashuwape shaaketanaw koyidi gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Nuna haysas giigisiday Xoossaa. Qassi sinthafe yaanabas oythi oothidi ba Ayyaana nuus immis.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Hessa gisho, nuuni ha sa7a asatethan de7iya wode ubban Godaape haakidi de7eysa erikoka ubba wode ammanetidi de7oos. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Nuuni de7ey ammanonape attishin, be7iyaban gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Nu ha sa7a asatethafe shaaketidi, nu soo bidi Godaara issife daanaw amotiya gisho, ammanetidi de7oos. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Hessa gisho, nu ha asatethan de7in woyko ha asatethafe shaaketin, nu amoy iya ufaysanaysa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Nuuni issoy issoy ha sa7an de7ishe lo77o gidin woyko iita gidin, oothida oosuwas bessiya pirdaa ekanaw Kiristoosa pirda araata sinthan shiiqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Roome 14:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ase Xoossara Sigetho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Hiza, Godaa yashshi ay guusseko nuuni eriya gisho, asay nu odeysa ekana mela zoroos. Xoossay, nuuni ooneko nuna erees; qassi hinteka hinte kahan nu ooneko ereeta yaagada qopayis. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Wozanan gidonashin, malan ceeqetiya asaa doona oythanaw hinte nunan ceeqetana mela hintew gaaso gidanaw koyoosipe attishin, nu nuna zaaridi nashshanaw koyoko. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Nu gooshshi gidiko Xoossa bonchosa; wozanaama gidiko hintesa. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Issoy ubbaas hayqidaysanne ubbay qassi iyara hayqidaysa nu eriya gisho, Kiristoosa siiqoy nuna haarees. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />De7on de7eysati hizape guye bantaw gidonashin, entaw hayqidaysasinne hayqope dendidaysas daana mela Kiristoosi asa ubbaa gisho hayqis.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Hizape guye, nuuni oonaka asa qofan pirdoko. Haysafe kase nuuni Kiristoosaka asa qofan be7idaba gidikoka, hizape hessada be7oko. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Hessa gisho, oonika Kiristoosan de7iko ooratha medhetethi; gal7a medhetethay aadhis; ubbayka oorathi gidis. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Hessa ubbaa Xoossay oothis. I Kiristoosa baggara nuna baara sigethis. Qassi harata baara sigethana mela nuus sigetho ooso immis. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Xoossay Kiristoosa baggara asa ubbaa baara sigethees. Enta nagaraa taybibeenna; qassi asaa baara sigethiya qaala nuus immis.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Xoossay asaa nu baggara xeegiya gisho, nu Kiristoosan kiitetidi asaa Xoossara sigetite gidi Kiristoosa gisho, woossoos. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Nuuni Xoossaa xillotethaa Kiristoosa baggara ekana mela, nagara eronna Kiristoosa nu gisho, nagarancho asada oothis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nagarancho asada: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagara yarsho oothis.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Nuuni Xoossara issife oothiya asi gideysada, hinte ekida aadho keehatetha hada oothonna mela nu hintena woossoos. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Ta nena si7ana woden si7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">atotetha gallasan nena maaddas” yaagees. Heko, ta si7iya wodey ha77i; atotetha gallasay hachi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa 49:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Oonika nu oosuwa borana melanne nunan dhubetana mela koyoko. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Gidoshin, nu tuma Xoossaa oosanchota gideysa nu oothiya ubbaban bessida. Daro gencan, waayen, meton, un7an, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />garaafetethan, qashon, ixon kumida wocaman, daaburan, dhisko dhayon, xooman,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Hawa 16:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />geeshshatethan, eratethan, danda7an, keehatethan, Geeshsha Ayyaanan, tuma siiqon, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />tumaa odaninne Xoossaa wolqan nuuni iya oosanchota gideysa bessida. Qassi xillotethay nuus tooranne gondalle. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Nuuni bonchetidanne tooshetida; cayetidanne galatetida. Tumaa haasayoos, shin asay nuna wordancho gidoosona. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Nu asan eretida asi, shin eretonna asa mela gidida. Hayqidosona yaagetida, shin paxa de7oos; shocetida, shin hayqibooko. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Nuuni azzanikoka ubba wode ufaytoos. Nu manqo daanos, shin daro asaa dureyoos. Qassi aykoyka bayna asi daanos, shin ubbay nubaa.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Qorontoosa asato, nu hintew qoncen odida; nu uluwa hintena bessida. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Hinte nuna hinte siiquwa bessonna diggidetape attishin, nuuni nu siiquwa hintena diggibooko. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Aawu ba naytas odeysada ta hintew odayis; nu hintena nu uluwa bessidaysada, hinteka hinte uluwa nuna bessite.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanonna Asara De7iya Gahetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ammanonna asaara bessonna ogen waaxettofite. Xillotethasinne nagaras aybi gahetethi de7ii? Poo7osinne dhumas aybi issifetethi de7ii? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kiristoosanne Xalahe issife gathiyabay aybee? Qassi ammaneysinne ammanonaysi issife koxiyabay aybee? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Xoossaa Keethas eeqatara aybi issifetethi de7ii? Xoossay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Taani enta giddon de7ana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">enta giddon hemetana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Taani enta Xoossaa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">entika ta ase gidana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:16">gidaysada, nuuni de7o Xoossaa keethi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Leewe 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Hiz 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:16">2 Qoro 3:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Hessadaka, Goday,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Enta giddofe shaaketidi keyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">tuna gididaba bochofite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ta hintena ekana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa 52:11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ta hintew aawa gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">hinte taw adde naytanne macca nayta gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Same 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Taari 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Ermi 31:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Hiza, ta siiqoto, ha ufaysay nuus de7iya gisho, nu ashuwanne nu shempuwa tunisiyaba ubbaafe nuna geeshshos. Xoossas yayyidi nu geeshshatetha polo oothoos.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ufaysa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Hinte uluwa nuna bessite. Nuuni oonaka naaqibooko; oonaka qohibooko; oonaka cimmibooko. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Taani hessa hinte bolla pirdanaw giike. Haysafe kase ta hintew odidaysada, hinte nu wozanan de7eeta; nu paxa de7inka hayqinka hintefe shaaketoko. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ta odiyaba hintefe qotike; ta hintenan ceeqetayis; nu waaye ubban minettayis; qassi gita ufaysi ufaytayis.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Nuuni Maqedoone bida wode, ubba baggara waayetidaape attishin shempibooko. Karera morketan, nu gaathan yashshan un7etida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:13">2 Taari 2:13</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Shin azzanidaysata minthethiya Xoossay, Tito yuussan nuna minthethis. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Nuna minthethiday Tito yuussaa xalaala gidonashin, hinteka iya minthethidaysa. Hinte tana laamoteysa, taw azzaneysanne taw qopeysa ta si7ida wode tana daro ufaysis.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ta dabdaabey hintena azzanthikoka ayis xaafadinasha gada qiirotike. Ta qiirotiday ta xaafida dabdaabey hintena guutha wodes azzanthida gishosa. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ha77i taani ufaytiday, ta hintena azzanthida gisho gidonashin, hinte azzanoy hintena hinte nagarape zaarida gishosa. Xoossay ba sheniyada hintena azzanthisipe attishin nu hintena aybinka qohibooko. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Xoossay koya azzanoy, atotethako gathiya nagarape simo ehees; iyan qiiroyabay baawa. Shin ha sa7a azzanoy hayqo ehees. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Hinte azzanoy hintenan ayfisida ayfiya be7ite. He azzanoy hintena ay mela denthethidako, ay mela zaaro immanaada giigisidaako, he ura bolla ay mela hanqethidaako, ay mela taw yayyana mela oothidaako, ay mela amoydako, he ura seeranaw ay mela giigidaako be7ite. Ha ubbaban hinte geeshshi gideysa markaydeta.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Hessa gisho, taani ha dabdaabiya hintew xaafiday, naaqida ura woyko naaqetida ura gisho gidenna. Shin hinte nuus ay mela qopiyako Xoossa sinthan hinte, hintena be7ana mela xaafas. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Nuuni ufaytiday hessa gishosa. Nu ufaysaafe aadhidi nuna daro ufaysiday, hinte Tito ufaysidaysanne iya wozanaa shempisidaysa. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Taani hintena nashshada iyaw odin, hinte tana yeellaybeketa. Shin nuuni ubba wode hintew tuma odida; hessadaka nuuni Tito sinthan hintena nashidaysi tuma gidis. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Hinte iyaw yashshan kokoridi, iya mokidaysa qassi iyaw ay mela kiitetidaako, I qopiya wode hintew de7iya siiqoy minnishe bis. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Taani ubbaban hintenan ammanetiya gisho ufaytayis.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ufaysan Imoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Nu ishato, Xoossay Maqedoonen de7iya woosa keethatas immida aadho keehatethaba hinte erana mela nu koyoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Roome 15:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Enti gita meton paacetidosona, shin enta ufaysay wolqaama. Enta manqotethas zawi baawa, shin banta imuwan daro keehidosona. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Enti banta wolqaa melanne banta wolqafe aadheysa dosidi immidaysas ta marka. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Enti Xoossa ase maaddiya lo77o ooso nuura oothanaw koydi nuna daro woossidosona. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Enti nuuni qopidaysafe aathidi oothidosona. Xoossa sheniyada, koyrottidi bantana Godaas immidosona; kaallidi, bantana nuus aathidi immidosona.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ha lo77o oosuwa doomida Titoy, gujidi oothanaadanne hintena maaddidi, he oosuwa polisanaada iya woossida. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Shin hinte ubbaban, ammanon, odan, eratethan, gita amon, nuna dosoninne ubbaban duretidaysada ha lo77o oosuwanka hinte keeha gidana mela nu koyoos.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Taani hessa kiittanaw giike. Shin harata gita amuwa hinte siiquwara gatha be7ada, hinte ay keena tumeeko eranaw gayis. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Hinte, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatetha ereeta. Kiristoosi dure gidi uttidi, hinte iya manqotethan duretanaada hinte gisho manqis.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Taani ha odan hintena maaddiya zore zoranaw koyayis. Hinte zillaythi immanaw xalaala gidonashin, hessa oothanaw amotisheka hinte koyro. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Hinte oothanaw doomida oosuwa ha77i polite. Hinte hintew de7eysa keena immiko, hessi hinte immanaw daro amotteysa qoncisees. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Issi asi immanaw amotiko, iya imoy Xoossa sinthan eketey, I baw de7idaysa keena imminape attishin, baynabape immanaw un7etin gidenna.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Taani hessa gey, hinte ubbay issi gina gidana melasafe attishin, harati waayiyape shempin, hinte waayetana melasa gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Wode enta palahay hinte pacaa kunthana mela, ha77i hinte palahay enta pacaa kuntho. Hessan hinte gina gidana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Daro shiishidaysas palahibeenna; guutha shiishidaysas pacibeenna” geetetidi xaafetidaysa mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kessa 16:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titonne Iya Laggeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Nuuni hintew qopeysada Titoyka hintew qopana mela oothida Xoossay galatetto. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Titoy hinteko biday, nuuni iya denthethida gisho xalaala gidonashin, I ba shenen baanaw amotida gishosa. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Wongela markatethan woosa keetha ubban daro eretida isha, nuuni Titora issife kiittoos. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Hessa bolla nuuni ha keeha imota efiya wode nuura baana mela, ha lo77o oosuwan Godaa bonchanawunne harata maaddanaw de7iya amuwa bessanaw I woosa keethatan dooretis.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ha imetida keeha imuwa, nuuni ooso bolla peeshshiya wode boretonna mela naagetoos. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Nuuni Godaa sinthan xalaala gidonashin, asa sinthanka lo77o gididaba oothoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Leemi 3:4</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Qassi daro wode paacen minnidi aadhida nu ishaa, entara hinteko kiitida. I hintenan daro ammanetiya gisho, ha77i hintena maaddanaw daro amottees. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Titoba eranaw koyko, hintena maaddanaw taara oothiya ta ooso lagge. Hanko ishataba gidiko woosa keethati kiittidaysata; qassi asay enta duussa be7idi Kiristoosa bonchoosona. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Hessa gisho, woosa keethati hinte siiquwanne nu hintena nashiya nashoy tuma gideysa qoncisanaw hinte siiquwa ha asata bessite.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ammaniya Asaas Shiiqida Miishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ammaniya asaas kessiya miishiyaba ta hintew xaafanaw koshshenna. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Hinte maaddanaw keehi amotteysa ta erayis. Hinte Akaya asay, zillaythafe doomidi maaddanaw giigetidaysa taani Maqedoone asaas doona kunthada odas. Hinte gita amoyka entafe darota denthethis. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Ha oosuwan hintenan nu ceeqetiya ceeqoy hada gidonna mela koyro hintebaa ta odidaysada hinte giigetidi naagana mela ha ishata hinteko kiittas. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Maqedoone asay taara bidi, hinte giigetonna de7ishin, demmiko, nu hintenan yeellatana; qassi hinte nuupe aadho yeellatana. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Hessa gisho, ha ishati taape sinthatidi hinteko bidi, hinte immana gida imuwa kasetidi giigisana mela ta entana kiittas. Taani gakiya wode he imoy giigidi uttees. He wode he keehatetha imoy wolqan gidonashin, dosan gideysa erisees.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Haysa akeekite; guuthu zeriday guuthu cakana; daro zeriday daro cakana. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Xoossay ufaysan immiya uraa dosiya gisho, wolqan woyko dosi bayna gidonashin, issi issi asi ba wozanan qopidaysada dosan immanaw bessees. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ubba wode ubbaban koshshiyaba ubbaa demmidi lo77o ooso ubbaa oothanaw danda7ana mela Xoossay hintew ba anjuwa darsana. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“I ba shaluwa manqotas laallis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">iya xillotethay merinaw de7ana”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 9:9">yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Maz 112:9</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Zereysas zerethi, maanaw kathi immiya Goday, hinte zeriya zerethi darsidi immana. Hinte xillotetha ayfiyaka darsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:10">Isa 55:10</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Daro asay hinte immiya imuwa nuupe ekidi, Xoossaa galatanaada, hinte ubba wode darsidi immeyisata gidana mela Xoossay hintena ubba baggara dureyana. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ha hinte immiya imoy ammaniya asaa pacaa kuntho xalaala gidonashin, asay Xoossaa galatanaw gaaso gidees. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ha hinte oosoy hinte ammanuwa erisidi Kiristoosa Wongela hinte ammanidinne iyaw kiitetidi hintew de7iyaba entaranne haratara shaaketida gisho ubbay Xoossaa bonchana. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Xoossay hintew immida aadho keehatetha gisho enti hintew Xoossaa woossishe hintena be7anaw laamotosona. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Zawi bayna Xoossaa imuwas Xoossay galatetto.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Mootiya Asaas Zaarida Zaaruwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Taani hintera de7iya wode, “Shugo”, qassi hintefe haakiya wode “Nu bolla minnees” yaagetida, Phawuloosi, keehanne ashke gidida Kiristoosa sunthan hintena woossayis. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Taani hinteko biya wode nu asho qofara simeretiya asi oothidi qopiya asaa bolla mino qaalan odetanaw qofa qachas. Hinte bolla hessada odetana mela hinte tana oothonnaada hintena woossayis. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Nuuni ha sa7an de7ikoka ha sa7aa asada oletoko. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Nu ola miishey ha sa7aba gidenna. Shin miixa laallanaw wolqara de7iya Xoossa toora. Tumaara eqetiya palamanne, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Xoossa eratetha bolla otoron dendiya palamanne hada qofa ubba laalloos. Asa qofa ubbaa di77idi Kiristoosas kiitetana mela oothoos. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Hinte kiitetethay polo gidiya wode nuuni kiitetetha ixo ubbaa seeranaw giigetana.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Hinte ayfey be7ida mela pirdeta. Oonika bana Kiristoosaba gidi qopiyaba gidiko, nuka Kiristoosaba gideysa ero. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Goday taw immida maatan ceeqetikoka hessan yeellatike. He maatay taw imetiday hintena dichanaasafe attishin, qohanaasa gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Taani ta dabdaabiyan hintena yashisanaw koyada xaafidaba daanopo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Issi issi asay, “Phawuloosa dabdaabey deexonne wolqaama, shin iya som7on be7iya wode I daaburancho; iya odayka pathenna” yaagosona. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />He asati nu haahon de7ishe xaafiya dabdaabiyaninne matan hintera de7ishe oothiya oosuwa giddon dummatethi baynaysa akeeko.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Nuuni bantana nashshiya asatara nuna ginayanaw woyko gaaddeyanaw koyoko. Shin enti bantana bantara ginayidi woyko gaaddeyidi be7ishe eeya.<verse eid="2CO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Shin nuuni Xoossay nuus immida dhassan ceeqetoosipe attishin, zawa pinnidi ceeqetoko; he zaway hintekoka gakees. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Nuuni besseysafe aathidi ceeqetoko, shin Kiristoosa Wongela hinteko gathidaysan ceeqetoos. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Nuuni Xoossay essida zawape pinnidi, harati oothida ooson ceeqetoko. Gidoshin, hinte ammanoy diccana mela Xoossay immida zawan hinte giddon nu oothiya oosoy dalgana gidi qopoos. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Nuuni hara asi ba zawan oothida ooson gelidi ceeqetoko, shin hintefe pinnidi haratas Wongela markatanaw danda7oos. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Shin, Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Ceeqiya ubbay Godaa lo77otethan ceeqo” yaagidi xaafetis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Ermi 9:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Goday nashshiya uraape attishin, bana baw nashshiya uray nashetenna.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosanne Wordo Hawaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ta guutha eeyatetha hinte ha77ika danda7ana gada qopayis; hayyana danda7ite. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Xoossay hintew qopidaysada, taka hintew qopayis. Taani hintena geeshsha geela7ida issi addiya, Kiristoosas immanaw oycha wothas.<verse eid="2CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Shin shooshay ba geniyan Hewaanno balethidaysada ooni eri hinte wozanay iitidi Kiristoosas de7iya hinte suuretethaanne geeshshatetha aggandeti gada hirgayis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Medhe 3:1-5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Issi asi yidi, nuuni hintew markatida Yesuusape hara Yesuusa hintew markatiko, woyko hinte ekida Ayyaanapenne Wongelape hara ayyaananne Wongela hintew odiko, si77i gidi ekeeta.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Shin taani Yesuusi kiitida “Gita hawaareta” geetetidi xeegeteysatape guuxayis gada qopike. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Taani oda eronna asi gidikoka, eratethi taw de7ees. Hessa ta hintew daro ogen qoncisas.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Taani miishe oychonna Xoossaa Wongela hintew coo odidaysinne hintena dhoqu oothada tana toochidaysi taw nagara gidii? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Taani hintew oothanaw hara woosa keethatape miishe bonqa ekas. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ta hintera de7iya wode tana metinka hintefe issi asika waaysabike. Maqedoonepe yida ammaneysati tana koshshiyaba ubban maaddidosona. Hachi gakanaw ta hintew tooho gidabike sinthaska tooho gidike.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Filphi 4:15-18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kiristoosa tumatethay tanan de7ishin, ta ceequwa Akaya biittan tana oonika diggenna. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Ta haysa ayis gayna? Hintena dosonna gishoyee? Taani hintena doseysa Xoossay erees.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />“Nuka hinte mela oothoos” yaagidi ceeqiya hanko hawaareta ceequwa gaasuwa dhaysanaw ha77i ta ootheysa sinthaska oothana. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Haysa mela asati Kiristoosa hawaare daananaw bantana laammiya wordancho hawaaretanne cimmiya oosanchota. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Hessi malaalsiyaba gidenna; ayis giiko, Xalahey poo7o kiitancho daananaw bana laammees. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Hessa gisho, Xalahe oosanchoti xillotethaa oosanchota daananaw bantana laammiko hessi gitaba gidenna. Enti wursethan banta oosuwada ekana.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Gakida Meto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Oonika tana eeya gidi qoponna mela zaaradaka odayis. Ta hintew eeya daanikoka ta guuthara ceeqetana mela tana eeya oothidi ekite. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Taani haysada ceeqetada odetey, Goday koyeysada gidonashin, eeyatethan odayis. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Daro asay ha sa7aban ceeqetiya gisho, taka ceeqetana. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Hinte wozanaama gidiya gisho, eeya asaba ufaysan danda7eeta. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Oonika hintena aylleyiko woyko hintena bonqiko woyko baw maadetanaw hinteko shiiqiko woyko hinte bolla otortiko woyko hintena baqiko hinte danda7eeta. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Nuuni hessa oothanaw daro daaburancho gideysa yeellatashe ta odayis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Shin oonika minnidi ceeqetiko, taka ceeqetanaw minnayis. Taani hessa eeya asada odetayis. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Enti Ibraawee? Taka Ibraawe. Enti Isra7eelee? Taka Isra7eele. Enti Abrahaame sheeshee? Taka Abrahaame sheeshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Enti Kiristoosa oosancho? Taani gooshsha asada odayis, entafe aadhiya Kiristoosa oosancho. Taani ooson daro daaburas; daro wode qashetas; garaafetas; daro wode hayqope attas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Hawa 16:23</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ayhudeti tana hastamanne uddufuna ichashu toho garaafidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Zaare 25:3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Heedzu toho xam7an shocetas; issi toho shuchan cadetas; markabey heedzu toho me77is; abba giddon issi qamma kumethi aqada pee7as.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Hawa 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14:19</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Taani daro ogiya daaburan hemetas. Kixa haathafenne pangafe attas. Ayhudetinne Ayhude gidonna asay ta bolla meto gathidosona. Katamay, bazzoy, abbay, tana yashshis; ammaniya daaniya asati tana waaysidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Hawa 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Taani ooson daaburasinne cawatas, daro toho dhisko dhayas, koshatas, saamotas, daro toho xoomas, meegetas, kallotas.<verse eid="2CO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Haraba ubbaa taybonna ubba wode tana qofisey woosa keethatabaa. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Issi asi daaburiya wode iyara ta daaburabikina? Issi asi nagaran dhubetiya wode ta awude qiirotonna aggadina?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ta ceeqetanaw koshshiyaba gidiko taani daaburancho gideysa erisiyaban ceeqetana. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Merinaw bonchetida Xoossay, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa Aaway, ta wordotonnaysa erees. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Damasqo kataman kawa Arisxoosape garsara haareysi tana oythanaw koyidi Damasqo katamaa pengiya naagisis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Hawa 9:23-25</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Shin asay tana daachon yeggidi, katamaa dirsaa maskootiyara wodhisin taani iya kushiyape attas.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Be7ida Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ceeqetethas go77i baynaysa erayis. Shin ceeqetanaw koshshiko, Godaape ekida qoncethan ceeqana. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Tammanne oyddu laythafe kase, Kiristoosa ammaniya issi uray heedzantho saluwa bidaysa ta erayis. He uray ashon woyko ashope karera bidaako ta erike; Xoossay erees. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />He uray heedzantho saluwa eketidaysa erayis. Shin I ashon woyko ashope karera eketidaako ta erike; Xoossay erees. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />He uray gannate eketidi asi qoncisanawunne asi odanaw danda7onnaba si7is. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Taani he addiyaban ceeqetana, shin taani ta daaburaape attishin, tanan ceeqetiyabay baawa. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Taani tumaa odetiya gisho, ceeqetanaw koykoka eeya gidike. Shin asi ta ootheysa be7eysafenne si7eysafe aathidi qoponna mela gada ceeqetethi aggayis.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Taw qoncida gita qoncethan ta otortonna mela tana waaysanaw ta ashuwan caddiya Xalahiya kiitanchoy taw imetis. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ha waaysiyaba taape diggana mela taani Godaa heedzu toho woossas. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Shin Goday, “Ta wolqay ne daaburan qonciya gisho ta aadho keehatethay new gidana” yaagis. Kiristoosa wolqay tanan qoncana mela ta daaburan ufaytashe ceeqetayis. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Taani Kiristoosa gisho, daaburiya wode cayetiya wode waayetiya wode goodetiya wode metootiya wode ta daaburan ufaytayis. Ayis giiko, ta daaburiya wode, he wode minnayis.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Qorontoosa Asaas qopees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Taani eeya asada ceeqetas. Hessada ta ceeqetana mela oothiday hintena. Ta, ta huuphen eretonna asi gidikoka, “Gita hawaareta” geeteteysatape guuxike. Hessa taw markatanaw bessey hintenashin. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ta hinte giddon de7ashe danda7an oothida malaatatinne mallati ta tuma hawaare gideysa bessoosona. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ta hintew tooho gidonaysafe attishin, hara woosa keethatape hinte aybin guuxidetii? Hessi bala gidiko tana maarite.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Taani hinteko baanaw giigetishin haysi taw heedzantho. Ta hintenape attishin, hintew de7iyaba koyonna gisho hintena waaysanaw koyke. Yelidaysati banta naytas shalo minjoosonape attishin, nayti bantana yelidaysatas shalo minjokona. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ta hinte gisho, taw de7iyabaanne tana aatha imminka tana ufaysees. Yaatin, taani hintena hessada keeha siiqiya wode hinte tana guuthara siiqetii?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Gidikoka, ta hintew tooho gidike; waaysabike; shin hintena cimoninne genen oykidaba hintew daanonna aggenna. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Hari attoshin, ta hinteko kiitida asatape hintena cimmida asi de7ii? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Titoy hinteko baana mela taani woossas; qassi ammaniya ishaaka iyara yeddas. Yaatin, Titoy hintena cimmidee? Nuuni nu oosuwa issi ayyaanan oothibooko? Qassi nu hanoyka issino gidennee?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Nu ubba wode hinte sinthan nuna xillisanaw mootetiyaba hintew daanii? Nu Kiristoosan de7idi Xoossaa sinthan ha77i gakanaw odoos. Nu siiqo ishato, nu ha ubbaa oothey hintena dichanaasa. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ta hinteko biya wode ooni eri hinte ta koyeysada hanonna, qassi taka hinte koyeysada hanonna gahetonna aggoko gada yayyayis. Qassi ooni eri hinte giddon palami, qanaatey, hanqoy, yiiqey, zigirsi, asa sunthu iisoy, otoroynne kachi doonna aggenna gada yayyayis. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Taani nam7antho hinteko biya wode Xoossay hinte sinthan tana kawushana gada yayyayis. Kase nagara oothidi he banta oothida tunatethaafe, laymatethafenne yeellayiya oosuwape simmiboonna asata be7ada azzanonna aggike gada yayyayis.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Zorenne Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ta hinteko bishin haysi heedzantho. Ay mootoyka nam7u woyko heedzu markan minnees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zaare 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Taani nam7antho hintera gahetida wode hinte giddon kase nagara oothida uraanne harata ubbaa seeronna aggike gada oda wothas. Ha77i ta haakada de7ikoka simmada hinteko biya wode oodeska qadhetike.<verse eid="2CO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Tanan de7idi odey Kiristoosa gideysa hinte eranaw koyeeta. I hintera haasaya wode wolqaamape attishin, hinte giddon daaburancho gidenna. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Kiristoosi masqale bolla daaburan kaqetis, shin Xoossa wolqan de7on de7ees. I daaburancho gididaysada, nuka daaburancho. Shin hintena haggaazanaw Xoossaa wolqan iyara de7on daana.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ammanon minnidi de7iyako hintena hintew paacidi be7ite. Paacen hinte kundonna attiko, Kiristoosi hintenan de7eysa hinte ereeta. Shin Kiristoosi hintenan doonna ixiko hinte kundeeta. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Nuuni paacen kundonaysa hinte ereeta gada ammanayis.<verse eid="2CO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Hinte iitabaa oothonna mela nuuni Xoossaa woossoos. Nuuni mino gideysa asay be7ana mela gidonashin, nuuni mino gidonna ixikoka, hinte lo77o oothana mela nuuni woossoos. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Nuuni tumaas oothoosipe attishin, tumaara eqetiyaba aybaka oothoko. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Nu daaburiya wode hinte qassi minniya wode nuna ufaysees. Hinte borey baynayisata gidana mela nu hintew Xoossaa woossoos.<verse eid="2CO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Taani hintefe haakada de7ashe xaafiday hessa gishosa. Taani hinteko biya wode Goday taw immida maatan zempada hinte bolla godatanaw koyke. Goday taw maata immiday, hintena maaddanaasafe attishin, qohanaasa gidenna.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Wursethan ta ishato, saro de7ite. Borey bayna de7ite; ta zoriya si7ite. Issi wozanan gididi de7ite; sarotethan de7ite. Siiqonne saro immiya Xoossay hintera gido.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Geeshsha yeeretethi yeeretishe, issoy issuwa sarothite. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Xoossaa asa ubbay hintena saro saro yaagosona.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethay, Xoossaa siiqoy, Geeshsha Ayyaana issifetethay hinte ubbaara gido.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>